WEBVTT

00:05:28.699 --> 00:05:33.037
and felt the intergenerational trauma
from the colonial experience

00:05:33.079 --> 00:05:36.207
and the horrors of residential
schools or institutions,

00:05:36.248 --> 00:05:39.585
where Indigenous children were forcibly
removed from their homes

00:05:39.627 --> 00:05:42.421
and sent to so-called "schools"

00:05:42.421 --> 00:05:45.591
to be indoctrinated
into the dominant Canadian society,

00:05:45.591 --> 00:05:48.094
I've found no better strategy to healing

00:05:48.135 --> 00:05:51.097
than nurturing our
relationship with our place.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:55.893
I've seen the healing powers
of the land in action countless times.

00:05:56.268 --> 00:05:57.770
The land heals

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:03.526
and I wish that experience for anyone
who has experienced and lives with trauma.